# Form controls style (Crown)

All inputs and selects must match the Requests page `list-filters` look:

- Compact: `padding: 0.26rem 0.55rem`, `font-size: 0.8125rem`, `min-height: 1.8rem` (already global in `wwwroot/css/crown.css`).
- Labels: uppercase muted `.form-label` (same file).
- Prefer Bootstrap `form-control` / `form-select` — do not invent taller “card form” inputs.
- Filter bars: `list-filters` + `filter-field` / `filter-field-inline`.
- Entity forms: `transport-form-grid` or simple `mb-2` stacks; no oversized chrome around fields.
- Exception: login page (`.login-layout`) keeps the larger pre-filter field style — do not compact it.
